I’m ready to apply it, but I don’t currently have an executable `run_sql` tool available in this session, so I can’t directly run it against prod from here.

Use this migration:

```sql
BEGIN;

ALTER TABLE users
  ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS email_verified boolean;

ALTER TABLE users
  ALTER COLUMN email_verified SET DEFAULT false;

UPDATE users
SET email_verified = true
WHERE email_verified IS NULL;

ALTER TABLE users
  ALTER COLUMN email_verified SET NOT NULL;

COMMIT;
```

Result:

- Existing users get `email_verified = true`
- New users default to `email_verified = false`
- Column is enforced as `NOT NULL`

